# LocalDJ 🎵

> **Smart local-first music playlist generator**

![Python 3.11+](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.11%2B-blue.svg)
![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green.svg)
![CI](https://github.com/your-org/localdj/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)

## Features

- 🎵 **Recursive library scanning** — discovers MP3, FLAC, M4A, AAC, OGG, WAV, ALAC
- 🏷️ **Metadata extraction** — reads ID3, Vorbis, and MP4 tags via mutagen
- 🥁 **BPM detection** — librosa-powered beat tracking (optional)
- ⚡ **Energy analysis** — RMS, spectral centroid, zero-crossing rate
- 🔊 **Acoustic fingerprinting** — chromaprint/pyacoustid (optional)
- 📋 **Smart playlist modes** — energy curve, vibe presets, artist clustering
- 💾 **SQLite persistence** — tracks, playlist runs, ratings, A/B results
- 📁 **M3U8 export** — with EXTINF metadata
- 🎛️ **Auto-tuner** — weight adjustment from ratings and A/B comparisons
- 🖥️ **Rich CLI** — progress bars, tables, coloured output

## Installation

```bash
# Basic install (no audio analysis)
pip install localdj

# With audio analysis (BPM + energy detection)
pip install "localdj[audio]"

# Development
git clone https://github.com/your-org/localdj
cd localdj
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

## CLI Usage

### Scan a music library
```bash
dj scan ~/Music
dj scan ~/Music --db ~/my-library.db
dj scan ~/Music --json   # machine-readable output
```

### Generate a playlist
```bash
# Energy curve (default)
dj generate --mode energy-curve --shape arc --length 30

# Vibe preset
dj generate --mode vibe --preset chill_sunday --length 20

# Artist cluster
dj generate --mode cluster --seed-artist "Radiohead,Portishead" --length 25

# BPM-filtered
dj generate --bpm-min 120 --bpm-max 140 --output ~/playlists/
```

### Tune weights
```bash
dj tune                   # show current weights
dj tune --dump-weights    # print as JSON
dj tune --apply suggestions.toml
```

### View history
```bash
dj history --last 20
```

### A/B comparison
```bash
dj ab-compare --config-a config_a.toml --config-b config_b.toml
```

## How It Works

```
Music Directory
      │
      ▼
 [Scanner]  ──────────────────► AudioFile list
      │
      ▼
 [Analyzer]  metadata + BPM + energy + fingerprint
      │
      ▼
  [DB Store]  SQLite (tracks, runs, ratings)
      │
      ▼
  [Engine]  energy-curve / vibe-preset / cluster
      │
      ▼
  [Tuner]  quality scoring + weight adjustment
      │
      ▼
 [Exporter]  ──────────────────► playlist.m3u8
```

